{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">由《魔音女團》組成的 MYNT，第二首派台作品《純粹好感》（同時為《女神配對計劃2》主題曲）的 MV 即將於 9 月 29 日隆重面世！成員莊子璇（Hilary）日前特別在社交平台率先晒出一輯 MV 中的純白造型照，讓一眾粉絲先睹為快！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相中可見，莊子璇身穿一襲純白露肩薄紗裙，置身於綠意盎然的自然背景中，白皙肌膚更是「白到反光」。美照一出，即吸引大批網民留言洗版激讚：「仙子璇」、「小仙女」、「仙氣爆燈，好靚」！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b072036c-4c21-480a-8a34-984560a552d7.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20268LCvdBeYmL1790651921.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b072036c-4c21-480a-8a34-984560a552d7.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e43d4b6f-9a84-4d29-bd32-56ad96075f61.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026j3hrOixSLu1790651922.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e43d4b6f-9a84-4d29-bd32-56ad96075f61.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">而在照片的最後，更揭曉了 MYNT 全員統一以純白 Look 造型登場。各成員在草地上自由奔跑，畫面充滿撲面而來的青春氣息！看到如此唯美的預告照，粉絲們紛紛激動留言表示極度期待完整版 MV：「等唔切了好期待」、「支持」！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"698cc074-a77b-4920-9b4e-9bac988e8918.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026BSkWTKhKwc1790651922.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"698cc074-a77b-4920-9b4e-9bac988e8918.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T03:39:50.081621+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}